node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
packages/web/dist
# `**/` matters: .dockerignore patterns do not cross `/`, so a bare
# `*.tsbuildinfo` matched only the repo root and let every packages/*/ one
# through. `tsc -b` then read that stale incremental state, concluded the build
# was current, emitted no dist/ — which IS excluded above — and produced an image
# whose entrypoint did not exist. Broken for anyone building from a tree they had
# already built in, i.e. every maintainer.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.finesign-data
.git
.env
.env.*
*.log
coverage
.DS_Store
